The '''Retro-Encabulating Visor''' is a {{Mythic}} [[Helmet]].

== Obtaining ==
A '''Retro-Encabulating Visor''' can be claimed from {{NPCSprite|Unhinged Kloon}} at the beginning of their quest. It can be re-purchased from them for {{Motes|1,000}}.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Helmet
|name = Retro-Encabulating Visor
|rarity = m
|intelligence = -50
}}
While wearing a '''Retro-Encabulating Visor''', pathways from {{NPCSprite|Unhinged Kloon}} to eight different terminals can be seen. Opening a terminal requires the player to hack it.

The hacking menu contains five numbers at the top (2-16), and five rows of moving numbered items. Each row corresponds to the top number that matches its offset, meaning the top row corresponds to the left-most number, and the bottom row corresponds to the right-most number.

Each row must be selected when its corresponding number matches the number vertically aligned with it. For instance, in the example UI shown below, the first row was selected and hacked because the top [[File:Hacking Keypad Red 12.png|25px]] {{Red|12}} matched the row [[File:Hacking Keypad Green 12.png|25px]] {{Green|12}} vertically.

Each row must be hacked within {{Green|75}} seconds. Clicking a row when the numbers don't align will remove {{Green|10}} seconds of time. Once all rows have been hacked, you must set that terminal to a specific color to make a rainbow when brought back to {{NPCSprite|Unhinged Kloon}}.
